{"type":"Film","id":"ES2016_040","slug":"es2016-040-acantilado","title":{"native":"Acantilado","english":"The Cliff"},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2016-06-03","year":2016},"filmType":"Fiction film","directors":[{"id":"Helena Taberna","slug":"helena-taberna","name":"Helena Taberna","birthYear":0,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Female identifying","nationality":"Spain","awards":[]}],"genre":["Thriller","Romance"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt4176928/mediaviewer/rm1079316736/?ref_=tt_ov_i","trailerUrl":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt4176928/?ref_=nv_sr_srsg_0_tt_8_nm_0_in_0_q_Acantilado"},"synopsis":{"native":"Gabriel es un prometedor fiscal cuya vida se tambalea cuando recibe una llamada de la policía. Ha habido un suicidio colectivo de una secta en las islas Canarias y su hermana pequeña, Cordelia, era una de las adeptas. Pero su cadáver no ha aparecido. Gabriel lleva años sin ver a su hermana, algo sucedió entre ellos y sus vidas tomaron rumbos opuestos. Viaja a la isla para conocer los sucesos de primera mano y ayudar en la investigación. Allí conoce a Helena, amiga de Cordelia, de fuerte personalidad y emociones a flor de piel. Ella y Gabriel conectan inmediatamente, unidos por el deseo de encontrar con vida a Cordelia.","english":"A mass suicide involving members of a cult takes place in the Canary Islands. Gabriel's younger sister, Cordelia, who he hasn't seen for years, was one of the cult followers. Gabriel decides to travel there and find out what happened."},"production":[{"country":"Spain","share":"Majority coproducer"}],"characters":[{"id":"ES2016_040_01","film":"ES2016_040","person":{"id":"Ana Gracia","slug":"ana-gracia","name":"Ana Gracia","birthYear":1959,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Female identifying","nationality":"Spain","awards":[]},"age":"2: Late Middle Age (55-60)","gender":"Female identifying","sexuality":"Unknown","origin":"White Western European","class":"Upper Middle class","profession":"Self-employed","ability":"Abl